{
  "name": "Leadership Ability Score",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Some of your features reference your Leadership ability score. It represents how you command the respect and loyalty of those around you, as well as how you lead them in battle. Perhaps you are an experienced veteran, survivor of dozens of military conflicts both large and small, a cunning tactician with an academic background in the study of warfare, or a driven idealist with a larger-than-life personality.</p><p>Choose Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma. The chosen ability score becomes your Leadership ability score.</p>",
